            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {}
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

The `security` field in the operation and the `components/securitySchemes` are both missing.
This is exactly the issue!

Why did it happen?
In `get_openapi_path`:
```python
